      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having this `Once` in the array inside `GicRedistributorRegistry` isn\u0027t very nice, as it\u0027s an implementation detail of this `new` method. How about instead, use an `Option` here, and then before returning `Self { redistributors }` you can map through the array to unwrap each element.\n\nThat way if for some reason a redistributor is missing for some core you get the failure immediately when `new` is called rather than later when you try to use it.",
